  "body": "## What changed\n- Added the clean-room Siemens Sinumerik 810M post in `assets/posts/sinumerik-810m.cps` (`Siemens 810M`).\n- Added the EMCO VMC-200 machine profile in `assets/machines/emco-vmc-200.mch` (`EMCO VMC-200`).\n- Registered both in `crates/app/src/posting_files.rs` and updated cross-post suites in `crates/app/tests/conformance.rs`, `crates/app/tests/machine.rs`, and `crates/post/tests/comment_escape.rs`.\n- Added pinning suites `crates/post/tests/sinumerik_810m_post.rs`, `crates/post/tests/script_sinumerik_810m.rs`, and `crates/app/tests/sinumerik_810m_post.rs`.\n- Added recorded goldens in `crates/post/tests/recorded/golden/sinumerik-810m/` and `crates/app/tests/golden/nc/sinumerik-810m/`.\n- Added an owner air-cut kit in `docs/tester-kits/sinumerik-810m-vmc200/` and decision notes in `docs/decisions/2888-sinumerik-810m.md`.\n\n## Cause\nThe existing Siemens post (`assets/posts/sinumerik.cps`) targets Sinumerik 840D (`%_N_..._MPF`, `;` comments, `G700`/`G710`, `G505`+, `CYCLE832`, and ISO G81-G89 blocks). Sinumerik 810M GA3 uses `%MPF1`-`%MPF9999`, parenthesized comments capped at 41 CRT chars, 120-char blocks, 4-digit `N9999` sequence numbers, `G71` geometry-only units (`F` stays metric), settable offsets `G54`-`G57` only, plain `G41`/`G42` without `NORM`, incremental `I`/`J`/`K` arcs, `G4 F` dwell, and `L81`-`L89` subroutine cycles with `R00`-`R11` parameters.\n\n## Tests\n- Step 5 pins reproduced red on `upstream/main` (`7 failed` in `camcraft-post`, `3 failed` in `camcraft-app`).\n- Post pins (`camcraft-post --test sinumerik_810m_post`): all 7 tests pass after final edits.\n- Recorded script suite (`camcraft-post --test script_sinumerik_810m`): all 11 cases pass.\n- App conformance, machine library, end-units, explain, smoothing, and kit tests pass (`90 passed; 0 failed` across targeted suites).\n- Mutation checks verified red on removal and green on restore for 5 guards: `workOffsetMax = 4` (offset 5/6 refused), `programUnits = \"mm\"` (inch document refused), `safeZ` (missing `safe_retract` on named machine refused), `N9999` (5-digit block numbers refused), and `L84` encoder dwell (`R08=-3` with bottom dwell refused).\n- Gate (`cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main`): green (761 steps, 0 failed).\n- Clippy (`cargo clippy -p camcraft-post -p camcraft-app --all-targets -- -D warnings`): clean (exit 0).\n\n## Goldens moved\n- Zero existing `.nc` or `.cl` goldens changed (`git diff --stat upstream/main -- \"*.nc\" \"*.cl\"` against our branch head `79376144c`).\n- Added 11 new recorded outputs in `crates/post/tests/recorded/golden/sinumerik-810m/`, 13 new conformance `.nc` files in `crates/app/tests/golden/nc/sinumerik-810m/`, `crates/app/tests/golden/nc/synth_sinumerik-810m.nc`, and `docs/tester-kits/sinumerik-810m-vmc200/air_cut_vmc200.mpf`.\n\n## Not exercised\n- Physical execution on an EMCO VMC-200 or Sinumerik 810M controller hardware (documented air-cut kit included for owner hardware read-back).\n- Optional post behaviors not present on base 810M: `G70` inch output (unsafe due to metric `F` feedrate), `FINEBORE`, probing, rotary/tilt axes, and `Control` WCS rotation.\n\n## Overlaps\nOpen PRs `#2515`, `#2646`, `#2951`..`#2999`, `#3046`, and `#3294` append different post/machine entries to the shared tables in `crates/app/src/posting_files.rs`, `crates/app/tests/conformance.rs`, `crates/app/tests/machine.rs`, and `crates/post/tests/comment_escape.rs`; none touch `sinumerik-810m.cps` or `emco-vmc-200.mch`. Whichever merges second refreshes.\n\nChangelog: Added Siemens Sinumerik 810M 3-axis milling post, EMCO VMC-200 machine profile, and owner air-cut kit.\nFixes #2888\n",
